<img alt="Warlock" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warlock.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warlock</span></a> Tier 11 - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=941/shadowflame-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowflame Regalia</span></a></h4>
<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="3" class="clean-markup-table-borders" style="width: 100%; max-width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 20%; max-width: 100%;">
<div class="box last" data-level="null">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=89934/item-warlock-t11-2p-bonus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Item - Warlock T11 2P Bonus</span></a>
<br/>
<i>2 Piece Bonus</i></div></td>
<td style="width: 80%; max-width: 100%;">Reduces the cast time of your <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=50796/chaos-bolt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warlock_chaosbolt.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chaos Bolt</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=71521/hand-of-guldan">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_summerfest_firespirit.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hand of Gul'dan</span></a>, and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=48181/haunt">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warlock_haunt.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Haunt</span></a> spells by 10%.</td></tr></tbody></table>
<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="3" class="clean-markup-table-borders" style="width: 100%; max-width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 20%; max-width: 100%;">
<div class="box last" data-level="null">
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=89935/item-warlock-t11-4p-bonus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Item - Warlock T11 4P Bonus</span></a>
<br/>
<i>4 Piece Bonus</i></div></td>
<td style="width: 80%; max-width: 100%;">Periodic damage from your <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=348/immolate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_immolation.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Immolate</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=30108/unstable-affliction">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_unstableaffliction_3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Unstable Affliction</span></a> spells have a 2% chance to cause your 2 next <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=77799/fel-flame">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_felfirenova.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fel Flame</span></a> spells to deal 300% increased damage.</td></tr></tbody></table>All the different <a class="icontiny c9" data-entity="class" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/class=9/warlock">
<img alt="Warlock" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warlock.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warlock</span></a> specializations benefit from both of the Tier 11 set bonuses. The two-piece bonus results in our stronger filler spell being cast slightly faster. The four-piece bonus has a chance to make our <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=77799/fel-flame">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_felfirenova.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fel Flame</span></a> deal extra damage making it worthwhile to use in our rotation.<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="gems">Gems</h4>Red, purple, and orange gems are the best for Warlocks. Warlocks will often ignore the color if the bonus is not big enough. Instead, we should fill it with a red intellect gem. Warlocks only want to use orange or purple gems to gain a powerful socket bonus or meet our hit cap. Typically, Warlocks will change their gems to gain or lose hit or haste rating. We do this to meet specific hit or haste rating caps.<br/>
<br/>Whether you want to go for a socket bonus over pure red gems will depend on the size of the bonus. A good rule is: if the socket bonus is under 20 Int or 30 of any rating stat, ignore it and gem red. Of course, this depends on your gear and stats. It would be best to <a href="https://wowsims.github.io/cata/" target="_blank">simulate</a> your character to find the best solution.<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Meta Socket - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68780/burning-shadowspirit-diamond">
<img alt="Burning Shadowspirit Diamond" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_metagem_b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burning Shadowspirit Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Red Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52257/brilliant-chimeras-eye">
<img alt="Brilliant Chimera's Eye" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_dragonseye05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Chimera's Eye</span></a> &gt; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71881/brilliant-queens-garnet">
<img alt="Brilliant Queen's Garnet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicgem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Queen's Garnet</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52207/brilliant-inferno-ruby">
<img alt="Brilliant Inferno Ruby" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior6.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Inferno Ruby</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Blue Socket -  <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71864/veiled-shadow-spinel">
<img alt="Veiled Shadow Spinel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicgem_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Shadow Spinel</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52217/veiled-demonseye">
<img alt="Veiled Demonseye" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Demonseye</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Yellow Socket -  <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71854/artful-lava-coral">
<img alt="Artful Lava Coral" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicgem_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Artful Lava Coral</span></a> &gt; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52205/artful-ember-topaz">
<img alt="Artful Ember Topaz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cutgemsuperior4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Artful Ember Topaz</span></a></div></li></ul>
<ul>
<li class="fa fa-arrow-right">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Check the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-enchants-gems-pve">
<b>Demonology Warlock DPS Enchants and Gems</b></a> guide for more details on Demonology <a class="icontiny c9" data-entity="class" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/class=9/warlock">
<img alt="Warlock" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warlock.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warlock</span></a> Enchants and Gems.</div></li></ul>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="reforging">Reforging</h4>Reforging is a system introduced in Cataclysm that allows you to convert 40% of one secondary stat or spirit on an item into another secondary stat or spirit. It can be used on any item with an item level of 200 or higher. You can only reforge one stat per item at a time. We usually convert them into hit rating until we are capped. After which we can use reforging to meet our most realistic "soft haste cap" at which point our damage over time abilities get an extra tick of damage. After that our priority is mastery.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Hit Cap &gt; Realistic Soft Haste Cap &gt; Mastery</b></div></div>
<ul>
<li class="fa fa-arrow-right">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Check the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/classes/warlock/demonology/dps-stat-priority-attributes-pve">
<b>Demonology Warlock DPS Stat Priority and Attributes</b></a> guide for more details on Demonology <a class="icontiny c9" data-entity="class" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/class=9/warlock">
<img alt="Warlock" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_warlock.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Warlock</span></a> Stat Priority and Attributes.</div></li></ul>
