<div style="text-align: -webkit-center;">Realistic Pre-Raid Best in Slot Example</div></h5>This example setup does not include any Archaeology rewards, World Drop Bind on Equip items, or items that cost <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
