<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="back">Back</h3>It shouldn't come as a surprise that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67131/ritssyns-ruminous-drape">
<img alt="Ritssyn's Ruminous Drape" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ritssyn's Ruminous Drape</span></a> is our best cloak on paper. It has one of the highest item levels and a socket slot. However it is a Bind on Equipped World Drop and as such will be incredibly expensive to buy on the Auction House. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58193/haunt-of-flies">
<img alt="Haunt of Flies" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Haunt of Flies</span></a> is another shiny epic option but does cost us 1250 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>, which we can get at most a 1600 of per week. As such we should ideally spend this on the biggest possible update such as our tier set pieces. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56371/shadow-of-perfect-bliss">
<img alt="Shadow of Perfect Bliss" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_healer_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadow of Perfect Bliss</span></a> has a slightly lower item level but already comes with hit rating on it making it at least as valuable if not better depending on the rest of your gear setup. Note that you might want to reforge the critical strike rating on the cloak. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56267/periwinkle-cloak">
<img alt="Periwinkle Cloak" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_caster_b_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Periwinkle Cloak</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62357/cloak-of-ancient-wisdom">
<img alt="Cloak of Ancient Wisdom" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloak of Ancient Wisdom</span></a> also make for good options though both will need some reforging to get the most out of it.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Cloak Enchant</b>:<a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=75172/lightweave-embroidery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightweave Embroidery</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=197/tailoring">
<img alt="Tailoring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_tailoring.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tailoring</span></a>) &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74240/enchant-cloak-greater-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Greater Intellect</span></a></div>
