<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest</h3>Just like our back, we got a Bind on Equipped World Drop option and an epic option that we can spend our hard-earned and saved <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> on. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67133/dizzes-whirling-robe">
<img alt="Dizze's Whirling Robe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_raidwarlock_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dizze's Whirling Robe</span></a> technically has the slightly better stats but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60251/shadowflame-robes">
<img alt="Shadowflame Robes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_raidwarlock_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowflame Robes</span></a> is part of <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=941/shadowflame-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowflame Regalia</span></a> which has a valuable 2-pieces bonus. On top of that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67133/dizzes-whirling-robe">
<img alt="Dizze's Whirling Robe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_raidwarlock_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dizze's Whirling Robe</span></a> will be only available for those with deep pockets. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56311/inquisition-robes">
<img alt="Inquisition Robes" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inquisition Robes</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62441/robes-of-orsis">
<img alt="Robes of Orsis" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Orsis</span></a> should be easier to get alternatives that both provide a solid amount of hit rating. Those unlucky in heroics and not revered yet with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1173/ramkahen">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ramkahen</span></a> can always opt to spend their <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a> on <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58153/robes-of-embalmed-darkness">
<img alt="Robes of Embalmed Darkness" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_robe_dungeonrobe_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of Embalmed Darkness</span></a> as a temporary solution.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74250/enchant-chest-peerless-stats">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Peerless Stats</span></a></div>
