<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs</h3>This is another slot where we can buy a part of our <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item-set=941/shadowflame-regalia">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shadowflame Regalia</span></a> with <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. Due to the nature of <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> being capped to a 1600  weekly it will take us a long while to get these. As an alternative, we can craft/<wbr/>buy either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54506/flame-ascended-pantaloons">
<img alt="Flame-Ascended Pantaloons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Flame-Ascended Pantaloons</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54505/breeches-of-mended-nightmares">
<img alt="Breeches of Mended Nightmares" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_cloth_raidpriest_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Breeches of Mended Nightmares</span></a>, both lack hit rating something to be mindful of if you are under the hit cap. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56413/legwraps-of-astral-rain">
<img alt="Legwraps of Astral Rain" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legwraps of Astral Rain</span></a> is fairly close in stats and won't set you back a solid amount of gold but does require you to get lucky to see it drop from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=39587/isiset">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Isiset</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4945/halls-of-origination">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Halls of Origination</span></a>.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Pants Spellthread</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54448/powerful-enchanted-spellthread">
<img alt="Powerful Enchanted Spellthread" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_thread_eternium.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Powerful Enchanted Spellthread</span></a></div>
