<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="feet">Feet</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58485/melodious-slippers">
<img alt="Melodious Slippers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_raidmage_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Melodious Slippers</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62450/desert-walker-sandals">
<img alt="Desert Walker Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_raidwarlock_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Desert Walker Sandals</span></a> are fairly similar options. Both provide a solid amount of hit rating along with having a higher item level. Ideally, we would save our limited <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> and rather get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62450/desert-walker-sandals">
<img alt="Desert Walker Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_raidwarlock_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Desert Walker Sandals</span></a> if we can get too exalted with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1173/ramkahen">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ramkahen</span></a>. Of course, there are more options than only epic ones which will take us a long time to get. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56348/slippers-of-the-twilight-prophet">
<img alt="Slippers of the Twilight Prophet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Slippers of the Twilight Prophet</span></a> has a solid amount of hit rating and drops from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=42333/high-priestess-azil">
<span class="tinyicontxt">High Priestess Azil</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5088/the-stonecore">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Stonecore</span></a>. Alternatively <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=66937/sandals-of-the-courier">
<img alt="Sandals of the Courier" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_robe_dungeonrobe_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Courier</span></a> also provides hit rating but doesn't require you to rely on RNG but instead complete <a class="icontiny" data-entity="quest" data-game="wow" data-type="quest" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/quest=28853/kill-the-courier">
<img alt="Kill the Courier" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kill the Courier</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4950/grim-batol">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Grim Batol</span></a>.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Boot Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52782/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
<img alt="Enchant Boots - Lavawalker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Lavawalker</span></a> &gt; <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52769/enchant-boots-precision">
<img alt="Enchant Boots - Precision" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Precision</span></a></div>
