<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67129/signet-of-high-arcanist-savor">
<img alt="Signet of High Arcanist Savor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pearlring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Signet of High Arcanist Savor</span></a> is a great ring that has a lot of stats including hit rating, however seeing as it is a World Drop it will be hard or expensive to get. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65169/lavishly-jeweled-ring">
<img alt="Lavishly Jeweled Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_76.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lavishly Jeweled Ring</span></a> alternatively provides a solid amount of hit rating and can be found in the heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=1581/the-deadmines">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Deadmines</span></a>. Similarly <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62415/band-of-lamentation">
<img alt="Band of Lamentation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_kingsring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Lamentation</span></a> /<wbr/> <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62427/band-of-singing-grass">
<img alt="Band of Singing Grass" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_69.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Singing Grass</span></a> also has a solid amount of hit rating and only required us to get revered with <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1172/dragonmaw-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonmaw Clan</span></a> /<wbr/> <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1174/wildhammer-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Wildhammer Clan</span></a>. Plenty of other great rings can be found inside dungeons such as <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56276/anthias-ring">
<img alt="Anthia's Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonering2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Anthia's Ring</span></a> or <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56432/band-of-rays">
<img alt="Band of Rays" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_57.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Band of Rays</span></a> for example. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64904/ring-of-the-boy-emperor">
<img alt="Ring of the Boy Emperor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_ring-of-the-boyemperor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of the Boy Emperor</span></a> is also a solid ring requiring 150 <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=401/tolvir-archaeology-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Tol'vir Archaeology Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_titan_fragment.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tol'vir Archaeology Fragment</span></span></a>.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74217/enchant-ring-intellect">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Intellect</span></a> (<a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=333/enchanting">
<img alt="Enchanting" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchanting</span></a>).</div>
