<br/>
<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Warlock DPS in Pre-Raid</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="2-handed-weapons">2-Handed Weapons</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64489/staff-of-sorcerer-thane-thaurissan">
<img alt="Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_staffofsorcerer_than-thaurissan.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Sorcerer-Thane Thaurissan</span></a> is likely our best pre-raid weapon. Note that you will likely want to reforge part of the critical strike chance to either hit rating or mastery based on your needs. To get the staff you will need to do a whole lot of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=794/archaeology">
<img alt="Archaeology" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Archaeology</span></a> Surveys to collect <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=384/dwarf-archaeology-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Dwarf Archaeology Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_dwarf_artifactfragment.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dwarf Archaeology Fragment</span></span></a>. There are quite a bit of other possible weapon alternatives such as other staves or 1-handed weapon and offhand combinations.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Weapon Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52774/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
