<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="1-handed-weapons">1-Handed Weapons</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69844/vitreous-beak-of-julak-doom">
<img alt="Vitreous Beak of Julak-Doom" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vitreous Beak of Julak-Doom</span></a> might be our best weapon depending if it is in its epic state or rare <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67246/beak-of-julak-doom">
<img alt="Beak of Julak-Doom" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Beak of Julak-Doom</span></a>. Either way both drop of the rare <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=50089/julak-doom">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Julak-Doom</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4922/twilight-highlands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Twilight Highlands</span></a> and are bound on equip. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55064/elementium-spellblade">
<img alt="Elementium Spellblade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_grimbatolraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Spellblade</span></a> is a great alternative that also provides hit rating and can be crafted by a <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=164/blacksmithing">
<img alt="Blacksmithing" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_blacksmithing.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blacksmithing</span></a>. Alternatively, the "free" option is <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56441/modguds-blade">
<img alt="Modgud's Blade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_cataclysm_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Modgud's Blade</span></a> which drops from <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=39625/general-umbriss">
<span class="tinyicontxt">General Umbriss</span></a> in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4950/grim-batol">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Grim Batol</span></a> but relies on RNG to see the drop.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Weapon Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52774/enchant-weapon-power-torrent">
<img alt="Enchant Weapon - Power Torrent" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Power Torrent</span></a></div>
