<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="offhand">Offhand</h3>Most off-hands are straightforward <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62234/dungeoneering-guide">
<img alt="Dungeoneering Guide" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_book_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dungeoneering Guide</span></a> and can be bought easily due to being crafted by <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=773/inscription">
<img alt="Inscription" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tradeskill01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscription</span></a>.  <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57923/hermits-lamp">
<img alt="Hermit's Lamp" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_outlandraid_03orange.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hermit's Lamp</span></a> is also a great option and can be bought with your hard-earned <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=395/justice-points">
<span>
<img alt="Justice Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-justice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Justice Points</span></span></a>. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56306/beautys-favorite-bone">
<img alt="Beauty's Favorite Bone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Beauty's Favorite Bone</span></a> on the other hand will have you delve into the <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=4926/blackrock-caverns">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Blackrock Caverns</span></a> to get. All of these provide a solid amount of hit rating and should fit well with any main-hand weapon you use.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Offhand Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52768/enchant-off-hand-superior-intellect">
<img alt="Enchant Off-Hand - Superior Intellect" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Off-Hand - Superior Intellect</span></a></div>
